<Base title="About — Luis Cielak">
  <div class="wrap page">
    <h1>Meet Luis</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I’m Luis Cielak, a Lead Product Designer based in Philadelphia, originally
        from Mexico City. I help organizations turn complex ideas into clear,
        intuitive digital experiences—with craft, empathy, and measurable results.
      </p>
      <p>
        My design journey didn’t start with wireframes. It began with asking better
        questions: Why is this broken? What’s standing in the user’s way? How do we
        make this simpler, faster, or more humane?
      </p>
      <p>
        Over the past decade, I’ve led design across fintech, B2C, B2B SaaS,
        e-commerce, and data-rich platforms—often working on products where the
        stakes are high and the systems are complex. Whether I’m building a design
        system or shaping strategy with stakeholders, I focus on delivering
        clarity—for users and for the business.
      </p>
      <p>
        I thrive in ambiguity and love connecting dots across research, interface
        design, and information architecture. I believe great UX is invisible but
        undeniable—it builds trust, reduces friction, and scales.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I’m not in Figma or interviewing users, you’ll find me brewing
        kombucha or perfecting a sourdough culture.
      </p>
